    "placements.navel_desc": "Navel anatomy varies drastically. A viable navel piercing requires a distinct upper or lower lip with depth in the navel cavity. If the stomach folds while seated, waistbands press the bottom bead upward, acting as a direct lever that drives the top ball forward through the skin. \"Floating navel\" jewelry with a tiny flat disk on the bottom eliminates this seated pressure.",
